### Health Check (ohne Auth)
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Health Check (API)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health

### Login (erfolgreich)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@schule.de",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Login (falsches Passwort)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@schule.de",
  "password": "falsch"
}

### Login (fehlende Felder)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Login Rate Limit (5x schnell hintereinander)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "x@y.de",
  "password": "x"
}

### Refresh Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/refresh

### Logout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout

### ─── Ab hier JWT erforderlich ───
@accessToken = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Eigenes Profil
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Profil aktualisieren
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "NeuerName"
}

### Fächer auflisten
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subjects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Fach anlegen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subjects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mathematik",
  "short": "MA"
}

### Fach anlegen (fehlerhaft)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subjects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "short": ""
}

### Ohne Token (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subjects

### ─── Schul-Hierarchie + Beitrittsanfragen (öffentlich, ohne Auth) ───

### Schulen öffentlich (für Registrierung)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/schools

### Klassen einer Schule öffentlich
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/classes?school_id=1

### Schüler-Registrierung (201, optional mit Beitrittsanfrage)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "neu.schueler@schule.de",
  "password": "schueler123",
  "first_name": "Neu",
  "last_name": "Schueler",
  "school_id": 1,
  "requested_class_id": 1
}

### Schüler-Registrierung doppelt (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "neu.schueler@schule.de",
  "password": "schueler123",
  "first_name": "Neu",
  "last_name": "Schueler",
  "school_id": 1
}

### ─── Als Superadmin (admin@schule.de) ───

### Schule anlegen (nur superadmin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/schools
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gymnasium Musterstadt"
}

### Schulen auflisten
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/schools
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Schul-Admin anlegen (superadmin; school_id = Zielschule)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "schuladmin@schule.de",
  "password": "schuladmin123",
  "first_name": "Schul",
  "last_name": "Admin",
  "role": "school_admin",
  "school_id": 1
}

### ─── Als Schüler ───
@studentToken = PASTE_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE

### Eigene Zugehörigkeit (Schule, Klassen, offene Anfragen)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/me/membership
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Beitrittsanfrage stellen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/classes/1/join-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ─── Als Lehrer / Schul-Admin ───
@staffToken = PASTE_STAFF_TOKEN_HERE

### Anfragen einer Klasse auflisten
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/classes/1/join-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Anfrage freigeben (Transaktion -> class_members)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/join-requests/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Anfrage ablehnen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/join-requests/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
